@startuml Sequence_Guru_Login
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #2980B9
    ActorBorderColor #1B4F72
    LifeLineBorderColor #2980B9
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #EBF5FB
    ParticipantBorderColor #1B4F72
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #EBF5FB
    ParticipantFontColor #1B2631
    GroupBorderColor #B7950B
    GroupBackgroundColor #FEF9E7
}

actor "Guru" as Guru
boundary "Halaman Login\n(auth/login.blade.php)" as View
control "AuthController" as Ctrl
entity "Model Karyawan\n(karyawan)" as Model

title **SEQUENCE DIAGRAM - LOGIN GURU**

activate Guru
Guru -> View : 1: Buka halaman web
activate View
View --> Guru : 2: Tampilkan halaman login

Guru -> View : 3: Masukan NIK dan password
Guru -> View : 4: Klik tombol login
View -> Ctrl : 5: prosesLogin(nik, password)
activate Ctrl

Ctrl -> Ctrl : 6: Terima data input login
Ctrl -> Ctrl : 7: Validasi format input

alt #FDEDEC Tidak (Input Tidak Valid / NIK & Password Salah)
    Ctrl --> View : 8: Return status login gagal
    View --> Guru : 9: Tampilkan pesan error
else #EAFAF1 Ya (Kredensial Valid)
    Ctrl -> Model : 10: Auth::guard('karyawan')->attempt(kredensial)
    activate Model
    Model --> Ctrl : 11: Return data user & otentikasi berhasil
    deactivate Model

    Ctrl -> Ctrl : 12: Buat sesi login (auth guard)
    Ctrl --> View : 13: Arahkan ke halaman utama (redirect ke dashboard)
    deactivate Ctrl
    View --> Guru : 14: Tampilkan dashboard guru
end

deactivate View
deactivate Guru
@enduml
